<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/optical-sensors">Optical &amp; Sensors</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Camera Modules &amp; Sensors</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Optical &amp; Sensors products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s active" href="/markets/optical-sensors/camera-modules"><span class="abbr">CM</span><span class="label">Camera Modules &amp; Sensors</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/optical-sensors/mems-sensors"><span class="abbr">MS</span><span class="label">MEMS &amp; Optical Sensor Packages</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the module has to see or display and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Optical &amp; Sensors &middot; Camera Modules &amp; Sensors</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Camera module manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures complete camera modules using controlled cleanroom assembly and active optical alignment between the lens and image sensor. The process supports precise focus, field-of-view control and protection of the sensor surface throughout assembly.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-camera-modules" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-optical-sensors-card-mems-sensors.webp" alt="Camera modules with lens holders over the image sensor" style="height:420px;object-fit:cover;" /></div></div></section><section id="specialize-camera-modules" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana builds camera modules from image-sensor assembly through lens integration, active optical alignment and finished-unit test. Lens position is set against a live image before being fixed in place, allowing focus and field-of-view performance to be controlled during production. Assembly runs on cleanroom lines under controlled handling conditions.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Complete camera modules</span></div><div class="desc">Image-sensor assembly through to a focused, tested camera module supplied as a complete optical unit.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Infrared and specialist modules</span></div><div class="desc">Infrared camera modules and specialist optical assemblies, including surface-mount lens housings.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Lens housings and optical sub-assemblies</span></div><div class="desc">Lens housings and optical sub-assemblies integrated with the image sensor as part of the camera-module build.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See Micro Assembly for the precision die handling, alignment, bonding and cleanroom processes supporting camera-module manufacturing.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/microelectronic-assembly/micro-assembly">Explore Micro Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Active optical alignment</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">During active alignment, the lens is positioned while the image sensor is operating so focus can be set against the actual optical output of the module. Once the required alignment is reached, the lens is fixed in place. Focus and field of view are then verified during finished-module test before shipment.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><div class="note">camera modules</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">micro-assembly, sensor packaging</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What is active alignment and why does it matter?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Active alignment positions the lens while the image sensor is operating, allowing focus to be set against the actual optical output of the module rather than relying only on mechanical tolerances.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What camera module types can Hana build?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures complete camera modules, infrared camera modules, and the lens housings and optical sub-assemblies that support them, for consumer, automotive and industrial applications.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How is every module tested before shipment?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Camera modules can be tested at finished-unit level, including focus and field-of-view verification during production.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/optical-sensors" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Optical &amp; Sensors market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your camera module program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>